[{"title":"王彦芳绣荣堂","author":"成廷圭","text":"色丝不染胭脂井，银汉缲成五色纹。\n织女机中翻海水，谏官衣上绣春云。\n清严地位人谁到，错综天章手自分。\n他日锦归当白昼，江花江草亦欣欣。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18726,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送澧州王伯颜治中公昔征蛮有功","author":"成廷圭","text":"南荒万里握戎机，共诧君侯奏凯归。\n出界旧传铜作柱，过家新喜锦为衣。\n梯航入贡鲸波远，溪洞消兵羽檄稀。\n今日中原方用武，岂无卿相布天威。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18727,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"挽周古善尊师","author":"成廷圭","text":"看罢璚花去不还，今闻笙鹤在云间。\n十洲何处留真迹，万古无人出此关。\n林下故交同白发，江南旧业只青山。\n丹经已付无为子，月夜犹疑响佩环。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18728,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"沙子中监县二子善才善庆俱登第因名其所居之山曰联桂所以纪瑞也诗以美之 其一","author":"成廷圭","text":"山翁高步月中来，移得灵根手自栽。\n仙籍许令诸子折，君家先见两枝开。\n双承御宴簪花出，并惹天香满袖回。\n自笑淮南谩招隐，连蜷偃蹇老苍苔。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18729,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"沙子中监县二子善才善庆俱登第因名其所居之山曰联桂所以纪瑞也诗以美之 其二","author":"成廷圭","text":"桂丛竞发山之阿，大株小株秋婆娑。\n灵鹫峰头月色薄，乌龙潭上天香多。\n吴刚持斧不敢近，郗诜对策将如何。\n岂惟二季在仙籍，诸孙还见援枝柯。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18730,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"和崔元初秋日舒怀感时叙旧情见乎辞 其一","author":"成廷圭","text":"淮南入幕皆名士，边土从军总贵游。\n万里又劳丞相出，九重独使圣君忧。\n禾生异亩虚占斗，木落空江欲变秋。\n召伯埭前听报捷，高邮城外解通舟。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18731,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"和崔元初秋日舒怀感时叙旧情见乎辞 其二","author":"成廷圭","text":"荔薜墙空雨气深，湿苔满径竹森森。\n城中不得三农信，塞上争禁十日阴。\n野佃负薪多未得，邻翁乞米数相寻。\n笙歌饮散者谁子，命驾归来醉堕簪。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18732,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"和崔元初秋日舒怀感时叙旧情见乎辞 其三","author":"成廷圭","text":"潇洒君家锦照堂，石泉秋水煮茶香。\n沿池筱簜鞭尤润，当户蒲萄叶半黄。\n东馆坏垣尘漠漠，西城残照晚苍苍。\n春时数听尚书履，几送池边月色凉。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18733,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"赠惟善驸马野云亭","author":"成廷圭","text":"万里飞来广漠云，随时舒卷故缤纷。\n风中不见孤飞迹，日下都成五色纹。\n从尔所之占隐者，更堪持以献吾君。\n明时用汝为霖雨，先向东南洗恶氛。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18734,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"六月二日书所见","author":"成廷圭","text":"干戈满地起风尘，民物凋零府库贫。\n黄犊乌犍烹作食，雕梁画栋拆为薪。\n江淮经理须贤俊，草泽诛求到隐沦。\n漫道宽心应是酒，老夫三日不沾唇。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18735,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"小轩有菊一本盛开两花大如酒杯饶介之见而爱之连赋诗二首因次其韵 其一","author":"成廷圭","text":"菊下呼儿典缊袍，相看无酒目空蒿。\n两花迭出金杯大，数叶轻攒翠羽高。\n就手折来香澹澹，满头簪得乐陶陶。\n曲生有意来相觅，留得芬芳荐蟹螯。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18736,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"小轩有菊一本盛开两花大如酒杯饶介之见而爱之连赋诗二首因次其韵 其二","author":"成廷圭","text":"满径香风吹客袍，却胜秋野醉攒蒿。\n东篱隐者世不泯，南阳老人年最高。\n大白杯中多趣味，中黄□内几钧陶。\n莫令雨后荒三径，更趁霜前斫两螯。","collection":"元","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18737,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"安庆大节堂至正十二年既陷武昌江州诸郡俱各失守时韩功懋总管守安庆指禦有方江淮赖为屏蔽廷心余帅书大节于堂以旌武功","author":"成廷圭","text":"战胜非难守胜难，逆图未伐胆先寒。\n焉知天下无诸葛，始信军中有一韩。\n当日雷霆归号令，至今烽火报平安。\n雄文大扁同时出，大节名堂后代看。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18738,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次饶介之述怀佳作 其一","author":"成廷圭","text":"读书不致卿相事，生计或与樵渔同。\n杜门真是守株者，傍人过呼居童翁。\n今晨把镜野服好，有月无酒山瓢空。\n绿阴满地鸟声罢，向日独有葵花红。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18739,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次饶介之述怀佳作 其二","author":"成廷圭","text":"千古万古道理大，海内海外车书同。\n青山看世等过客，白发催人吾已翁。\n干戈三载道路断，斤斧一朝林野空。\n西轩拭泪付长叹，怅望夕阳天际红。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18740,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题太湖李尹所收余廷心元帅书二封","author":"成廷圭","text":"两函妙墨古所见，一代高风人未知。\n用兵不下羊叔子，食粥正如颜太师。\n今日澄清在我辈，长江保障非公谁。\n更烦令尹回州日，补入舒人遗爱碑。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18741,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送拔寔彦卿被召之翰林直学士","author":"成廷圭","text":"天上仙人紫绮裘，偶题明月到扬州。\n日边使者徵方急，泉下奸臣死亦羞。\n宣室正思前席问，淮南谁赋小山幽。\n玉堂信与人间隔，肯为琼花更少留。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18742,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"夜泊长桥","author":"成廷圭","text":"十丈虹蜺跨碧空，行人过此莫匆匆。\n大鱼吹浪来船尾，明月流光出海东。\n根本旧邦唇齿近，边廷诸将腹心同。\n丰碑屹立书何事，特纪当年谢傅功。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18743,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"灯下有感","author":"成廷圭","text":"城郭空虚鸟乱鸣，彩旗拂柳夕阳明。\n山林乐土非畴昔，兵火残民思太平。\n海燕归来无旧主，野花满地有馀情。\n一尊酹月悲歌后，搔首灯前百感生。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18744,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"金溪葛氏二孝烈女祠","author":"成廷圭","text":"葛女祠前荐荔蕉，藤花风雨急飘萧。\n翠軿五夜灵氛下，银穴千年宝气销。\n太史已闻书孝烈，遗民无复困征徭。\n绛唇朱袖归黄土，惆怅何人说二乔。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18745,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"澹香亭","author":"成廷圭","text":"幽芳不自媚，白日净依依。\n风露已如此，山中人未归。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18746,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"画枯木","author":"成廷圭","text":"老树半无叶，石根馀野花。\n高秋上河汉，用汝作灵槎。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18747,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"墨兰","author":"成廷圭","text":"能让吴君子，伤谗楚大夫。\n延陵无宿草，湘水有新蒲。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18748,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"晚兴","author":"成廷圭","text":"多景栖红树，秋风落白云。\n捕鱼频得隽，惊鹭不成群。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18749,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"畎亩","author":"成廷圭","text":"畎亩心常白，江湖眼尚青。\n悠悠今古路，一一短长亭。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18750,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"画竹","author":"成廷圭","text":"笔间珠树长，不借白云栽。\n尽日看龙挂，空疑有雨来。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18751,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"赵承旨竹石","author":"成廷圭","text":"石间生石笋，笋长又成林。\n林下纤纤草，王孙去国心。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18752,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"坐雨","author":"成廷圭","text":"行云都是梦，听雨甚于秋。\n㶁㶁盈阶水，时时一尺流。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18753,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"居竹轩","author":"成廷圭","text":"定居人种竹，居定竹依人。\n新笋甜于肉，长竿健似身。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e