thor":"成廷圭","text":"吾亦怜吾竹，孤清人未知。\n向来多俗病，全得此君医。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18767,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题三友轩汤直学求赋三首 其三","author":"成廷圭","text":"古梅如古士，岁晚托同襟。\n不作玉堂梦，山林深更深。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18768,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题宋子章竹","author":"成廷圭","text":"黄陵只在断云西，苦竹丛深望欲迷。\n帝子不归春又晚，满林烟雨鹧鸪啼。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18769,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"洞宾出山像","author":"成廷圭","text":"散发空山只短衣，古来豪杰在知机。\n无人识是纯阳子，万壑千岩独自归。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18770,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"邓孝子行卷二首 其一","author":"成廷圭","text":"歌罢河东孝子诗，满堂宾客动嗟咨。\n何由得著斓斑服，一日娱亲十二时。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18771,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"邓孝子行卷二首 其二","author":"成廷圭","text":"哭尽秋天月不明，哀容憔悴欲无生。\n泪痕渍入泉台石，万古千秋父子情。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18772,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"徽庙御画栀子白头翁","author":"成廷圭","text":"栀子红时人正愁，故宫衰草不胜秋。\n西风吹落青城月，啼得山禽也白头。","collection":"元","notic